Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["GWPUser", "Title",
 CellID->1630160394,ExpressionUUID->"e9ce57aa-12f4-457c-aa10-623ba5c3e9d9"],

Cell["\<\
The GWPTools package provides a robust, object-oriented framework for \
simulating and analyzing generalized Gaussian wavepackets (GWPs). This \
user-focused technical note (GWPUser) introduces the front-end capabilities \
of the software, emphasizing applied quantum mechanics and physical insights \
rather than backend algorithmic derivations. By using the GWP constructor and \
interacting with the resulting polymorphic GWPObject, users can rapidly \
construct analytical wavepacket states, instantly extract exact spatial and \
momentum representations, and compute advanced energetic observables. This \
document covers the core 1D wavepacket framework, details rigorous physics \
extensions like Quantum Hydrodynamics, and previews experimental capabilities\
\[LongDash]including superposition states and non-unitary open quantum \
systems.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998762032653593*^9, {3.998762857296794*^9, 3.9987628706073847`*^9}, 
   3.9987630263999453`*^9, 3.998763161443266*^9, 3.9987633498485003`*^9},
 CellID->509373532,ExpressionUUID->"d21d294b-a49b-407c-a85d-00afaa56ac79"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Quick-Start Examples", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998762043417219*^9, 3.998762055137306*^9}, {
  3.998765195771755*^9, 3.998765200499198*^9}, {3.9987672798986073`*^9, 
  3.9987672803441963`*^9}},
 CellID->1901863395,ExpressionUUID->"5f517698-30ce-474a-9eda-b9e32f04f2a0"],

Cell["\<\
The GWPTools package must first be loaded into the Mathematica session. \
Assuming the paclet is properly installed on the local filesystem, initialize \
the framework using the standard Needs command:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998780000696299*^9},
 CellID->942130350,ExpressionUUID->"056a8986-6663-4a12-9a49-209e8992682e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Load the GWPTools package.", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998776928067679*^9, 3.998776939114841*^9}},
 CellID->987863119,ExpressionUUID->"c9ff7437-8443-43dd-98e2-359b853057e6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9987769248430967`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->819366076,ExpressionUUID->"922eee8b-813d-4bd5-bc26-d8f2e049a4d2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The core constructor for the package is GWP. By default, calling \
GWP[\"1D\"][] generates a static, minimum-uncertainty Gaussian wavepacket \
centered at the origin in phase space. The constructor returns a GWPObject, \
which acts as the primary data structure for querying physical properties.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998776955278537*^9, 3.9987800206149483`*^9, 
  3.99878222162037*^9},
 CellID->1377637296,ExpressionUUID->"e65fc081-d3a8-4be8-ace2-32a95d73f2bc"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Generate the default 1D GWPObject.", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998776985836121*^9, 3.998776999314451*^9}},
 CellID->1673689490,ExpressionUUID->"dab63236-3b50-4777-b72c-abfb778fb583"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"gwp", "=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9987770133551197`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",
 CellID->1958450024,ExpressionUUID->"66aa0f28-f444-405d-85bc-1c2a5b2bba8a"],

