Cell["\<\
Exact spatial and momentum representations are extracted directly from the \
GWPObject by passing the appropriate property string. For a static \
wavepacket, spatial properties evaluate strictly as a function of the \
position coordinate x.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998777038301758*^9, 3.998780046047323*^9, {3.9987805087714252`*^9, 
   3.99878051297488*^9}, {3.9987806115063677`*^9, 3.9987806116507797`*^9}},
 CellID->1039492319,ExpressionUUID->"21370d0b-ddba-4dd5-bdcb-414cece6cfba"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Evaluate the position-space wavefunction.", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998777109887743*^9, {3.998780542126554*^9, 3.998780543346806*^9}},
 CellID->521327919,ExpressionUUID->"c201208a-a5fb-47d2-92bb-12d7ce6ecc6d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"gwp", "[", "\"\<WavefunctionX\>\"", "]"}], "[", "x", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998777119917988*^9, 3.9987805316698027`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[3]:=",
 CellID->225054873,ExpressionUUID->"3a18b72c-7f6d-4efd-b7dc-fec0f53294a1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox[
     SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "4"]}]], 
  SuperscriptBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]"}], ")"}], 
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}]]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000412842542777*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[3]=",
 CellID->473643372,ExpressionUUID->"0dcd1ef4-1c81-484b-b9ef-a62cc2d84dac"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Evaluate the position-space probability density.", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998777092731985*^9, {3.99878054487465*^9, 3.998780573671401*^9}},
 CellID->930011991,ExpressionUUID->"fc6c01b3-f196-49c8-b5d4-0174b8f97319"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"gwp", "[", "\"\<DensityX\>\"", "]"}], "[", "x", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.99877707794731*^9, 3.9987805882712307`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",
 CellID->1325549871,ExpressionUUID->"7d26f243-5796-41d2-889a-81069975fed1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox[
     SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "2"]}]], 
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]"}]]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0004128425556498`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[4]=",
 CellID->1949757422,ExpressionUUID->"e96c09ca-7697-45f0-86e3-83920655a6ac"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
A time-dependent wavepacket is created by providing an active external \
potential using the \"Potential\" option. The package includes several \
built-in named potentials, such as the harmonic oscillator (\"HO\") and the \
free particle (\"Free\"). \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998782699654313*^9, 3.998782727153735*^9}},
 CellID->1542429510,ExpressionUUID->"b796bd9b-e13a-4e02-b4ff-eb9fbd52e9c3"],

Cell["\<\
To observe classical oscillatory motion, initial parameters can be passed \
directly to the GWP constructor. For example, a displaced wavepacket is \
constructed by passing a real shape parameter (1/2) as the first argument and \
an initial position offset (1) as the second argument.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998782699654313*^9, {3.998782731989182*^9, 3.9987827347698298`*^9}, 
   3.9987829624724817`*^9},
 CellID->2030887824,ExpressionUUID->"189a9b09-598d-49db-ad7f-c37f9641cee1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Initialize a displaced coherent state in a harmonic oscillator potential.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998777189724103*^9, 3.998777216841696*^9}, 
   3.9987825627100277`*^9},
 CellID->67245884,ExpressionUUID->"ba078adb-9e05-4c10-ba7a-6f0e523478af"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"gwpHO", "=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], ",", "1", ",", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Potential\>\"", "->", "\"\<HO\>\""}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998777194217411*^9, {3.998781100078086*^9, 3.998781112206395*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[5]:=",
 CellID->625174066,ExpressionUUID->"3e2be6ed-239f-47ac-9ef6-7536ead4263f"],

