Cell["\<\
GWPObject natively supports vectorization via list-threading across its \
coordinate and time arguments. Passing a list of times instantly generates a \
sequence of evaluated states, facilitating rapid data generation for \
visualizations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998777302596094*^9, {3.9987807101377983`*^9, 3.998780713256525*^9}},
 CellID->2065270224,ExpressionUUID->"383da113-5c69-40f3-82d8-fbf2682e5ad9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Plot the spatial probability density at three different times.\
