Cell["\<\
The constructor accepts several universal options that dictate the physical \
constants and environmental landscape. Options such as \"MASS\" and \"HBAR\" \
define the core physical constants, while \"Potential\" activates a \
continuous time-evolution model. The \"Summary\" option controls the visual \
formatting of the resulting GWPObject.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998835296969829*^9},
 CellID->1428988221,ExpressionUUID->"d08f1c4a-6fca-48de-b1f4-e232e331867e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Construct a time-dependent 1D wavepacket with custom mass and default \
formatting.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998834277236668*^9, 3.9988343090585213`*^9}, {
  3.998834963680173*^9, 3.998834973735291*^9}},
 CellID->1874706026,ExpressionUUID->"65ef5049-0777-4097-b1ff-c901664fd486"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\"\<MASS\>\"", "->", "2000"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Potential\>\"", "->", "\"\<HO\>\""}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Summary\>\"", "->", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998834254618452*^9, {3.998834313167172*^9, 3.998834315267783*^9}},
