Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The Introspection Framework", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998834349621364*^9, 3.9988343550429*^9}},
 CellID->1420794892,ExpressionUUID->"c125ac67-75d1-4385-806a-2e725faa8ee5"],

Cell["\<\
The package is entirely self-documenting, eliminating the need to reference \
static external indices of available functions. The framework's capabilities \
are accessible via two identical introspection pathways. Queries can be \
passed directly to the constructor type (e.g., GWP[\"1D\"]) to explore the \
physics capabilities before instantiating a specific state, or they can be \
passed directly to a constructed GWPObject.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998835318589237*^9},
 CellID->893682489,ExpressionUUID->"83167653-06db-46b4-a119-d649ad369663"],

Cell["\<\
Physical observables are categorically organized into property classes. The \
full taxonomy of registered classes can be retrieved using the \"Classes\" \
query.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->620965505,ExpressionUUID->"d9b3839e-c554-4af2-a81d-983f9ae587e1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Retrieve a list of all active property classes for the 1D wavepacket type.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998831179394432*^9, 3.998834405439281*^9},
 CellID->1609709241,ExpressionUUID->"269f428e-4d41-4ddc-927d-c9bbeeb7fafe"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Classes\>\"", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998831187209178*^9, {3.9988344506735563`*^9, 3.998834454085827*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[12]:=",
 CellID->384228581,ExpressionUUID->"4a8486f2-5ec6-45ca-b912-46d9446fac5f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"DynamicParameters\"\>", ",", "\<\"Energies\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"ExpectationValues\"\>", ",", "\<\"Probabilities\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"StaticParameters\"\>", ",", "\<\"Wavefunctions\"\>"}], 
  "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000412842905283*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[12]=",
 CellID->532433076,ExpressionUUID->"3a9b4cbc-a882-46fb-ae87-104da6800cb6"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
To discover specific observables, the general \"Properties\" query can be \
filtered by passing the name of a specific class as a secondary argument.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998831219937284*^9, 3.99883441592384*^9},
 CellID->987320113,ExpressionUUID->"18da457e-742d-40ff-9c2b-814127b3746f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
List all properties categorized under the probabilities class.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998831235782777*^9},
 CellID->1832406896,ExpressionUUID->"e30de0c8-19ee-4b86-a6b5-f31895d20ed6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<Properties\>\"", ",", "\"\<Probabilities\>\""}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998831244519744*^9, {3.998834460561798*^9, 3.998834463776173*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[13]:=",
 CellID->199719445,ExpressionUUID->"b8ab8859-06a4-4f7e-94de-bf30df82d881"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"CumulativeDistributionE\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"CumulativeDistributionP\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"CumulativeDistributionX\"\>", ",", "\<\"DensityE\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"DensityP\"\>", ",", "\<\"DensityX\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"ProbabilityE\"\>", ",", "\<\"ProbabilityP\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"ProbabilityX\"\>"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000412842912212*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[13]=",
 CellID->38351283,ExpressionUUID->"4c8dc4ac-8ec2-47fc-90ac-41199ddcf024"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Comprehensive metadata regarding how these properties evaluate mathematically \
can be extracted using the \"Records\" command. This generates structured \
datasets mapping each property to its distinct static and dynamic \
mathematical behaviors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.99883443833215*^9},
 CellID->1692563520,ExpressionUUID->"8746a3be-d1f0-496e-b5c9-10979a21d026"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Extract the detailed metadata records for all properties within the \
wavefunctions class.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998831235782777*^9, 3.998834488547626*^9},
 CellID->1526159203,ExpressionUUID->"01247223-7da0-4b89-9b17-ce82f2695e3e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Dataset", "[", 
  RowBox[{
