Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Discovering Potential Models", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9988366406511602`*^9, 3.998836645618547*^9}},
 CellID->826470486,ExpressionUUID->"745e79fd-3278-42a3-a36d-f870ef6126c5"],

Cell["\<\
To model continuous time evolution, the wavepacket must be assigned an \
external potential. The framework registers exact analytical time-evolution \
propagators for each wavepacket type. The available models and their exact \
input templates can be discovered using the \"PotentialRecords\" query.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1357892646,ExpressionUUID->"a2c75b1d-0d7f-4d4d-83cc-8e821001219a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Extract the registry of analytical potential models available to the 1D \
wavepacket type.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998836682502839*^9, 3.99883669385542*^9}},
 CellID->409549689,ExpressionUUID->"c7458f12-0e16-420b-b49a-dc352d7ca0f9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

