Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Dictionary Injections", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99884121656586*^9, 3.998841221210744*^9}},
 CellID->377735925,ExpressionUUID->"7ee54ed2-4ffb-4899-876d-01e4f347b1f7"],

Cell["\<\
Instead of calculating and inputting raw complex parameters manually, users \
can initialize the wavepacket by injecting specific physical target values \
using specialized dictionary lists. The constructor automatically parses \
these dictionaries into the foundational real and imaginary parameter \
components.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->194625449,ExpressionUUID->"3a1e2232-5572-4027-ad35-68bb9ac56320"],

Cell["\<\
Shape Dictionaries: The complex shape parameter can be defined by targeting a \
specific spatial uncertainty and covariance using {\"Covariance\", UX, \
COVXP}, or by defining the phase-space uncertainty bounds using \
{\"Uncertainty\", UX, UP, chirpSign}.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->452326962,ExpressionUUID->"fc7e8e33-9ca5-412e-90bd-aa56cfd114df"],

Cell["\<\
Momentum Dictionaries: The real momentum center can be defined by specifying \
a target classical kinetic energy and directional sign using {\"KineticEnergy\
\", KE, pSign}.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->167139954,ExpressionUUID->"bab56dd2-f748-4a82-8f04-b157db008046"],

Cell["\<\
Phase Dictionaries: The global complex phase can be injected using \
specialized lists such as {\"Action\", S, MU}, {\"Displacement\", X0, P0}, \
{\"Coefficient\", THETA, AMP}, or {\"Evolution\", EN, TAU}.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->212596602,ExpressionUUID->"fe74d66b-6fa1-4566-84ff-7068a5dcb808"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Construct wavepackets using dictionary injections for shape, momentum, and \
phase.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998841272648975*^9},
 CellID->833054236,ExpressionUUID->"eeb0fb50-ad0f-4c12-977b-e2b499825a3e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
